  "notes": {
    "p01.jpg": "Cover page: one full-width lead offer whose pack shots and serving photo run past the cell to all page edges, over a strip of three equal offers.",
    "p02.jpg": "Two-column kroner page where all three offers carry the same 10,- price splash and the section logotype sits between the rows rather than above them.",
    "p03.jpg": "A single offer occupies the whole editorial half of the page, with the rest given to a non-offer samlemærker banner.",
    "p04.jpg": "Pure full-bleed brand page with no priced offer at all; p06, p11, p21, p23 and p26 use this identical one-panel grid.",
    "p05.jpg": "Completely flat page: one column, two equally weighted full-width offers with no lead.",
    "p07.jpg": "A full-height coloured member-price column runs down the right third beside four ordinary dairy offers.",
    "p08.jpg": "Frozen-goods lead spans the top two thirds with its bread basket bleeding off the left edge, over a strict three-up double row.",
    "p09.jpg": "Six offers on three rows where the wide slot alternates side each row (right, left, right) instead of a fixed lead position.",
    "p10.jpg": "Six identically sized month-offers in a flat two-by-three block with no lead; the bottom two carry member-price badges but are the same size.",
    "p12.jpg": "Two stacked columns of three equal cheese offers, where the top-left offer has been pushed down by a white supplier text box rather than by another offer.",
    "p13.jpg": "A three-up row sits above a two-thirds-wide feature offer, and the bottom third of the page is serving-suggestion editorial with no offer in it.",
    "p14.jpg": "Green produce page where the lead mango photo prints over the member-bonus headline panel in the top-left corner.",
    "p15.jpg": "Award-winner page with a double-height meat hero in the right column and each left offer carrying its own explanatory body copy.",
    "p16.jpg": "Meat page whose lead pan shot bleeds off the left edge and the section heading is set in the gap between rows one and two.",
    "p17.jpg": "Four equal offers in a plain two-by-two with the section heading occupying the horizontal gutter; no hero at all.",
    "p18.jpg": "Deli page on a four-row right column of weekday offers against two double-height offers in the left column.",
    "p19.jpg": "Bakery offers are photo tiles butted edge to edge with round black price discs, and the lower third of the page is a partner advert band.",
    "p20.jpg": "The lead tuna bowl bleeds over the green intro panel and over the row below it, and row two mixes one narrow with one double-width offer.",
    "p22.jpg": "Two thirds of the page is a recipe/Madskole editorial block, with all four offers stacked in a single narrow right-hand strip.",
    "p24.jpg": "Wine page built as two stacked full-width bands over a three-up bottle row, with a non-offer Returret badge tucked in the second band.",
    "p25.jpg": "Top half is a photographed kitchen scene carrying a two-thirds-wide lead, while the bottom half switches to a tinted three-up panel of ordinary bottle offers."
  }
}
